    "reason": "Unverifiable and mis-linked. Its url is the CIPS homepage, and cips.ca names only the CIPS Ontario Women in Technology Conference and IT Professionalism Week — no Atlantic Technology Summit anywhere on the site. The record's date came from a 10times.com listing, an aggregator, not from an organiser. A listing whose own link does not describe the event gives a user nothing."
